#: svxerr.src#RID_SVXERRCODE.ERRCODE_SVX_LINGU_THESAURUSNOTEXISTS_ERRCODE_RES_MASK.string.text
#: svxerr.src%23RID_SVXERRCODE.ERRCODE_SVX_LINGU_THESAURUSNOTEXISTS_ERRCODE_RES_MASK.string.text
msgid ""
"No thesaurus available for the current language.\n"
"Please check your installation and install the desired language."
msgstr ""
"ለ አሁኑ ቋንቋ ዝግጁ ተመሳሳይ አልተገኘም\n"
"እባክዎን አገጣጠሙን ይመርምሩ እና የሚያስፈልገውን ቋንቋ ይግጠሙ"

#: svxerr.src#RID_SVXERRCODE.ERRCODE_SVX_LINGU_LANGUAGENOTEXISTS_ERRCODE_RES_MASK.string.text
#: svxerr.src%23RID_SVXERRCODE.ERRCODE_SVX_LINGU_LANGUAGENOTEXISTS_ERRCODE_RES_MASK.string.text
msgid ""
"$(ARG1) is not supported by the spellcheck function or is not presently "
"active.\n"
"Please check your installation and, if necessary, install the required "
"language module\n"
"or activate it under 'Tools - Options - Language Settings - Writing Aids'."
msgstr ""
"$(ARG1) በ ፊደል ማረሚያው የተደገፈ አይደለም ወይንም በ አሁኑ ሰአት ንቁ አይደለም \n"
"እባክዎን አገጣጠሙን ይመርምሩ እና የሚያስፈልገውን የ ቋንቋ ክፍል ይግጠሙ\n"
"ወይንም ያስነሱ 'መሳሪያዎች - ምርጫዎች - ቋንቋ ማሰናጃ - የ መጻፊያ እርዳታ'"

#: svxerr.src#RID_SVXERRCODE.ERRCODE_SVX_LINGU_LINGUNOTEXISTS_ERRCODE_RES_MASK.string.text
#: svxerr.src%23RID_SVXERRCODE.ERRCODE_SVX_LINGU_LINGUNOTEXISTS_ERRCODE_RES_MASK.string.text
msgid "Spellcheck is not available."
msgstr "ፊደል ማረሚያው ዝግጁ አይደለም"

#: svxerr.src#RID_SVXERRCODE.ERRCODE_SVX_LINGU_HYPHENNOTEXISTS_ERRCODE_RES_MASK.string.text
#: svxerr.src%23RID_SVXERRCODE.ERRCODE_SVX_LINGU_HYPHENNOTEXISTS_ERRCODE_RES_MASK.string.text
msgid "Hyphenation not available."
msgstr "Hyphenation ዝግጁ አይደለም"

#: svxerr.src#RID_SVXERRCODE.ERRCODE_SVX_LINGU_DICT_NOTREADABLE_ERRCODE_RES_MASK.string.text
